<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 15.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on July 15.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 July 15		July 14</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.360		  5.167</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	   9.919		 11.711</p>
<p>Cash balance		  15.269		 16.878</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,269.655	     5,269.655</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $8 million were issued and $360 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
